import crafttweaker.game.IGame;

game.setLocalization("got.dream", "You suddenly experience some sort of vision and quickly write it down before it fades.");

game.setLocalization("research.THEORYRESEARCH.title", "Inspirational Teas");

game.setLocalization("research.THEORYRESEARCH.stage.1", "For me to make any true progress as a thaumaturge, I cannot rely solely on observing the world around me or uncovering fragments of ancient knowledge. I must forge my own path, making discoveries through careful experimentation and contemplation. Only by developing my own theories can I hope to advance.
<BR>
To this end, I will first establish a calm and comfortable workspace in which to conduct my research. A warm cup of tea should help steady the mind and sharpen my focus.
<BR>
I sense that applying a small amount of Salis Mundus to Silverwood leaves may yield viable seeds, allowing me to take my first steps along this path.");

game.setLocalization("research.THEORYRESEARCH.stage.2", "Now that I have some tea, I can sit back, relax, and write down any discoveries I make, as long as I have my Thaumonomicon and scribing tools on hand.<BR>The different types of tea should help me focus on various kinds of discoveries, and each one should grant me some fundamental knowledge.<BR>I am certain that if I surround myself with inspiring objects, I can make discoveries even more quickly.");

game.setLocalization("research.CELESTIALSCANNING.stage.1", "The teas truly help me focus, allowing new theories and discoveries to take shape. However, I believe that if I can relax even further, I may be able to accelerate this process.
<BR>
Surrounding myself with inspiring and calming blocks and items would be a good place to start.
<BR>
A warm campfire, a bookshelf filled with intriguing tomes, a research table, and even the gentle bubbling of a crucible all seem to aid my work.");

game.setLocalization("research.Firebat.stage.1", "Pyrads are interesting beings. Despite being mostly made out of wood, they defend themselves with fire.<BR>This could potentially be useful in the future. ");

game.setLocalization("research.UNLOCKALCHEMY.stage.2", "My recent discoveries have given me a new insight into how the world is put together and I think I might know a way to transform matter by altering its Essentia.<BR>This will require experimentation and something to hold the alchemical substrate. A simple brewing stand will not do - what I need is a mystical crucible.<BR>A kettle is the right shape and size, but what is effectively a big metal bowl will never be able to hold the magical energies I wish to manipulate.<BR>Once again, applying some Salis Mundus to a kettle should resolve my problems.");

game.setLocalization("entity.Firebat.name", "Pyrads");
